# Keep text files LF in the repo AND in the working tree.
# The Serializer in js/admin/store.js emits LF and several tests compare
# generated text against checked-in files byte for byte, so a CRLF
# checkout on Windows breaks them for no real reason.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
